# Trial-Size Trial by Ice (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_ice): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Ice_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event). IP_Entrance with the clearance and the entry item gone: checkRequirements as
# no registrant fails: the handler returns nothing: the default.
lists CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfFrost/IP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfFrost/Ice_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfFrost/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfFrost/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=558.5,-0.8,600.0 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Sandoria.TrialSizeTrialByIce accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfIce
charvar Quest[0][107]Prog 1
login
trade IP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfIce x1  # the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                   # the fight, arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Ice_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Ice_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp 558.5,-0.8,600.0 CloisterOfFrost
trigger IP_Entrance                     # the clearance, the entry item gone: the default
